IT WAS NEVER OFF THE TABLE, AND

00:06:21.247 --> 00:06:24.050 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT DOES LOOK LIKE WE MAY BE

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:26.319 size:53% position:73% line:0%
GETTING CLOSER TO THAT

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:28.054 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EVENTUALITY, AND IT WAS COMING

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:30.189 size:53% position:73% line:0%
UP, BUT THAT WOULD SUGGEST IF

00:06:28.221 --> 00:06:31.057 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THERE IS A GROUND INCURSION, IS

00:06:30.356 --> 00:06:32.291 size:53% position:73% line:0%
