00:06:33.459 --> 00:06:36.295 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE MILITARY REASON, THAT WHICH

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:39.499 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IS A SINGLE DIVISION OF ARMORED

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:41.134 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INFANTRY THERE, BY GAZA, AND

00:06:39.665 --> 00:06:42.535 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT'S SIMPLY NOT ENOUGH FOR A

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.302 size:53% position:73% line:0%
COMPREHENSIVE GROUND OPERATION

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:45.171 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TO BE SUCCESSFUL.

00:06:43.469 --> 00:06:46.272 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE POLITICAL REASON IS THAT

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:48.074 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PRIME MINISTER NETANYAHU,

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:48.441 size:53% position:73% line:0%
