00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:53.079 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT LOOKS NOW, THE OPPOSITION

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:53.579 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WILL BE UNABLE TO PUT TOGETHER

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:56.082 size:53% position:73% line:0%
A GOVERNING COALITION.

00:06:53.946 --> 00:06:56.749 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHICH MEANS, ANOTHER SET OF

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:58.217 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ELECTIONS, IT'S ANOTHER, ONE IS

00:06:56.916 --> 00:07:00.186 size:53% position:73% line:0%
LIKELY LATER IN THE YEAR, WHICH

00:06:58.384 --> 00:07:03.055 size:53% position:73% line:0%
GIVES NETANYAHU ANOTHER CHANCE

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:04.223 size:53% position:73% line:0%
