00:07:03.222 --> 00:07:07.193 size:53% position:73% line:0%
POPULARITY COULD BE SEVERELY

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:08.361 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AFFECTED, AND IF THE GROUND

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.063 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INCURSION GOES, AHEAD AND THERE

00:07:08.528 --> 00:07:11.397 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ARE ANOTHER NUMBER OF ISRAELI

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.432 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CASUALTIES.

00:07:11.564 --> 00:07:13.299 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THESE ARE SOME OF THE

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:15.134 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CASUALTIES IT WILL BE GOING

00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:17.036 size:53% position:73% line:0%
