00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:23.209 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THERE HAS BEEN ONE OTHER

00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:25.111 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WORRYING ASPECT OF WHAT HAS

00:07:23.376 --> 00:07:27.079 size:53% position:73% line:0%
