00:07:30.983 --> 00:07:34.454 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT IS SOMETHING THAT THERE

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:35.254 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ARE OLD WOUNDS AND SOME OF

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:38.057 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THESE PLACES.

00:07:35.421 --> 00:07:38.324 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SOMETHING WE HAVEN'T SEEN

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:40.326 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BEFORE.

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.294 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THAT IS NOT SOMETHING THAT

00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:43.062 size:53% position:73% line:0%
