00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:48.034 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ISOLATED INCIDENCES OF VIOLENCE,

00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:50.136 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT NOTHING ON THIS SCALE, AND

00:07:48.201 --> 00:07:51.204 size:53% position:73% line:0%
CERTAINLY NOT HAVING ISRAELI

00:07:50.303 --> 00:07:52.371 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ARABS, AND ISRAELI JEWS ATTACK

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:54.040 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EACH OTHER, ON MICK CITIES, ON

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:54.273 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHAT SEEMS TO BE A NIGHTLY

00:07:54.207 --> 00:07:56.309 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BASIS.

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:58.077 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JUST HERE, YESTERDAY, A 19 YEAR

00:07:56.476 --> 00:08:01.113 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OLD ISRAELI SOLDIER WAS

00:07:58.244 --> 00:08:01.514 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ATTACKED, AND SUFFERED A

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:04.317 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FRACTURED SKULL.

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:04.584 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HIS STATUS IN HOSPITAL, NO

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:08.087 size:53% position:73% line:0%
