00:08:27.907 --> 00:08:33.045 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BUT, AS WE WORK TOGETHER, THERE

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:34.080 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IS STILL CONCERNS THAT MORE

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:37.083 size:53% position:73% line:0%
VIOLENCE MAYBE WORK TOGETHER,

00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:39.051 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND CERTAINLY, AS A PARTIAL,

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:40.086 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HERE AT THE ENTRANCE, THE

