00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.226 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HE IS THAT CONCERNED ABOUT MORE

00:08:46.225 --> 00:08:49.328 size:53% position:73% line:0%
VIOLENCE TAKING PLACE, HERE, IN

00:08:47.393 --> 00:08:51.330 size:53% position:73% line:0%
